d等网络协议，具备网络编程经验。\no扎实的算法与数据结构基础，有分布式系统或网络算法项目经验。\no良好的数学建模和系统分析能力，能用C/C++或Python实现算法。\no熟悉Linux内核网络栈基本原理。\n​优先考虑​\n有大型数据中心或超算中心网络优化经验。\n深入理解NCCL、UCX、MPI等集合通信库并有实践经验。\n熟悉可编程交换机（P4）或智能网卡（DPU/SmartNIC）技术。\n在SIGCOMM、NSDI、ATC等顶会发表过论文或有相关专利。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-20T18:33:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"799c0051-4109-4da8-acd2-7e1a1b60acb6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151125220,"PostDateInt":1768200103000,"PostDate":"2026-01-12T14:41:43","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"互联网销售团队负责人(J13384)","OrgId":2525875,"Org":"曙光智算","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["天津市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"一、岗位定位\n作为公司互联网销售业务的核心操盘者，全面统筹在线销售团队的战略规划、人才搭建与业务落地，核心目标为驱动在线业绩持续增长，助力公司强化市场竞争力、达成整体业务目标。\n二、岗位职责\n1.战略与目标管理：基于客户需求、竞品动态及行业趋势，制定在线业务中长期战略，拆解年/季度业绩目标并落地销售策略；优化Call Plan体系，实现客户分层与资源精准匹配，保障销售目标高效达成。\n2.体系搭建与标准化建设：主导搭建覆盖“客户开发-跟进转化-服务维护”等环节的互联网销售全流程体系，建立标准化业务制度，提升团队运营效率与合规性。\n3.高绩效团队建设：负责互联网销售团队（含管理岗）的人才梯队搭建、专业培养与激励考核，提升团队综合能力，推动人均效能与整体业绩同步提升。\n4.数据驱动优化：搭建互联网销售数据分析体系，定期复盘业绩、客户转化、资源投入等核心数据，快速识别业务瓶颈并迭代策略；向高层输出业务分析报告，为战略决策提供数据支撑。\n5.客户价值与跨协同：牵头重点客户开发与维护，深挖客户需求并提供定制化方案；联动产品/技术/售后等部门建立协作机制，提升客户满意度与复购率。\n6.行业对标与竞争力提升：跟踪行业头部企业的在线销售模式、产品组合、定价等策略，提炼可复用经验；结合公司业务特性，优化产品推广与营销策略，增强市场竞争力。","Require":"三、任职资格\n1.学历专业：本科及以上学历，市场营销、企业管理、通信/IT等相关专业优先；\n2.经验能力：5年及以上互联网销售团队管理经验，业务功底扎实，对在线产品逻辑及销售全流程有深刻见解；\n3.职业素养：极强的目标感与结果导向，能适应快节奏、高压力工作环境；\n4.业绩要求：拥有可验证的优异销售业绩，能独立统筹并达成高额销售目标；\n5.战略视野：能从行业发展与客户长期价值视角思考，制定长远业务规划，不局限于短期交易。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-12T14:41:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"