gGraph / LlamaIndex / AutoGen / AgentScope 等），理解其核心设计与实现机制，具备源码分析、二次开发或自研 Runtime 经验。\n5.具备较强的 Agent 工程化问题解决能力，有长链路任务、上下文管理、工具调用、状态恢复、执行稳定性等问题的实际排查与优化经验。\n6.熟悉 Prompt Engineering、Context Engineering、RAG、Function Calling 等 LLM 应用技术，熟悉企业知识库、向量检索及主流大模型生态。\n7.具备较强的业务抽象能力，能够将复杂业务需求拆解并落地为 Agent 工作流，有复杂 ToB 或生产级业务系统落地经验。\n8. Agent 产品高强度用户，深度使用 Claude Code、Cursor、Codex 等产品，对模型行为和 Agent 产品有较强的理解与判断力。\n加分项\n1.有开源 Agent 框架核心代码贡献，或有独立研发 Agent Harness / Runtime 并投入生产的经验。\n2.有 0→1 搭建 Agent Platform、AI 应用平台或 Multi-Agent 系统经验；有高并发、长任务、复杂业务流等生产环境落地经验。\n3.有 Agent Evaluation / Observability / Trace 体系建设及线上 Agent 效果优化经验。\n4.有 Coding Agent、Research Agent、Data Agent 等复杂 Agent 产品研发经验。\n5.有企业级 RAG、知识库、知识图谱或工业互联网相关项目经验。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-20T21:24:38","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAt